OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPersistent, frequently heavy
OL,6,Frain and strong winds for Cornwall and
OL,7,Fthe Isles of Scilly, with a risk of
OL,8,Fflooding and disruption. East of
OL,9,FCornwall, dull, cloudy and feeling
OL,10,Fcold, especially considering the brisk
OL,11,Fbreeze, and some spells of light rain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWind and rain mostly easing,
OL,14,Fthough perhaps light drizzly patches
OL,15,Flingering overnight. Cloudy for most,
OL,16,Fand feeling cold though without the
OL,17,Frisk of frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
