OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FLight rain in places to
OL,6,Fstart, then generally dry and cloudy
OL,7,Fthough there will be a few sunny
OL,8,Fspells forming by afternoon. Feeling
OL,9,Fcold in the gentle northeasterly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FCloudy and frosty on Thursday,
OL,14,Falthough some morning sunshine too. A
OL,15,Fwet and windy start to Friday, before
OL,16,Fturning drier by afternoon. Some
OL,17,Fbrighter spells Saturday morning
OL,18,Fbefore rain returns.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
